# Data Sources

This directory contains data source implementations for the infrastructure layer.

## Firebase Data Sources
- `firebase_user_data_source.dart` - User data operations with Firestore
- `firebase_post_data_source.dart` - Post data operations with Firestore

## Local Data Sources
- `local_preference_data_source.dart` - User preferences with SharedPreferences
- `local_task_data_source.dart` - Task management with SharedPreferences

All data sources follow the abstract interface pattern for testability and maintainability.
